00:00:08.428 --> 00:00:09.400
(audience clapping)

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:10.940
A New York city fashion blogger

00:00:10.940 --> 00:00:12.850
is helping shine a light
on people of color,

00:00:12.850 --> 00:00:14.840
making a splash in the style world.

00:00:14.840 --> 00:00:17.990
Claire Sulmers is the founder
of Fashion Bomb Daily.

00:00:17.990 --> 00:00:20.440
A site that chronicles
everything from fashion news

00:00:20.440 --> 00:00:22.650
to trends, to wardrobe advice.

00:00:22.650 --> 00:00:25.450
And with more than two point
four million viewers a month,

00:00:25.450 --> 00:00:27.010
the site is a great resource

00:00:27.010 --> 00:00:29.950
for what's happening in the
world of multicultural fashion.

00:00:29.950 --> 00:00:31.670
We've got Claire on the line just back

00:00:31.670 --> 00:00:33.279
from Paris Fashion Week.

00:00:33.279 --> 00:00:34.112
(audience clapping)
Great to meet you.

00:00:34.112 --> 00:00:37.262
(audience applauding)
Oh, you look fabulous.

00:00:37.262 --> 00:00:38.515
- Hi.
(audience clapping)

00:00:38.515 --> 00:00:40.360
(audience applauding)
- Oh my God you look stunning.

00:00:40.360 --> 00:00:41.450
You look so beautiful.

00:00:41.450 --> 00:00:42.930
It's great to meet you.

00:00:42.930 --> 00:00:47.230
So, why was it important for
you to create a site like this?

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:48.063
- Yeah.

00:00:48.063 --> 00:00:48.896
Well, growing up,

00:00:48.896 --> 00:00:52.560
I was a fashion fanatic
and also a magazine addict.

00:00:52.560 --> 00:00:54.010
But when I looked through magazines,

00:00:54.010 --> 00:00:57.060
I very rarely saw women
who looked like me.

00:00:57.060 --> 00:00:57.980
Kirby women.

00:00:57.980 --> 00:00:58.980
Women of color.

00:00:58.980 --> 00:01:01.500
And so I decided to
create Fashion Bomb Daily

00:01:01.500 --> 00:01:05.120
to be the change that I
wanted to see in the world.

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:08.520
And to create a simple
platform of one stop shop

00:01:08.520 --> 00:01:11.390
that showed women and men who reflected

00:01:11.390 --> 00:01:12.650
just dope style.

00:01:12.650 --> 00:01:14.820
Everyday people no matter their age,

00:01:14.820 --> 00:01:16.590
no matter their culture or background

00:01:16.590 --> 00:01:18.240
and no matter their size.

00:01:18.240 --> 00:01:19.073
- I love it.
(audience applauding)

00:01:19.073 --> 00:01:20.730
Oh, that's so cute.

00:01:20.730 --> 00:01:23.140
Well, you're not just
writing about fashion,

00:01:23.140 --> 00:01:24.560
you also created a marketplace

00:01:24.560 --> 00:01:27.330
to help small fashion designers
and businesses, right?

00:01:27.330 --> 00:01:28.240
- I did. Yes.

00:01:28.240 --> 00:01:31.130
In 2018, we created
Fashion Bomb Daily shop.

00:01:31.130 --> 00:01:34.480
It's a platform for emerging
multicultural designers.

00:01:34.480 --> 00:01:37.350
- And fashionism. Very
capital heavy business.

00:01:37.350 --> 00:01:38.780
If you're a beginning designer,

00:01:38.780 --> 00:01:40.980
a lot of times you need connections

00:01:40.980 --> 00:01:42.140
or you need a lot of money.

00:01:42.140 --> 00:01:43.800
And so I decided to create our...

00:01:43.800 --> 00:01:46.090
To use our wonderful platform

00:01:46.090 --> 00:01:48.830
to empower designers who
might not be able to connect

00:01:48.830 --> 00:01:51.670
to influencers or
celebrities, for example.

00:01:51.670 --> 00:01:54.830
And I'm actually wearing a
design from our shop today.

00:01:54.830 --> 00:01:56.650
Its by a designer named Oyawen.

00:01:56.650 --> 00:02:00.530
She's a Nigerian American
designer out of Atlanta

00:02:00.530 --> 00:02:03.400
and her designs have been
worn by Khloe Kardashian,

00:02:03.400 --> 00:02:06.960
Doja Cat and lots of
Housewives like Lilney White,

00:02:06.960 --> 00:02:08.691
Porsha Williams and Marlo Hampton.

00:02:08.691 --> 00:02:09.930
(audience applauding)
- That's amazing.

00:02:09.930 --> 00:02:10.763
It's awesome.

00:02:10.763 --> 00:02:12.317
You look so cool.

00:02:12.317 --> 00:02:14.740
Thank you so much Claire
for everything you're doing

00:02:14.740 --> 00:02:15.600
